# Charts published to an OCI registry by bin/publish-helm-chart.sh, run from the
# release workflows on a *.*.* tag: GHCR from GitHub, Harbor from Gitea.
#
# This list is opt-IN. Most charts under argocd-helm-charts/ are thin wrappers
# around an upstream chart, and republishing those under our namespace would
# redistribute someone else's artifact while giving consumers nothing they
# cannot pull upstream. Only first-party charts we author belong here.
#
# Opt-in also fails closed: --add-helm-chart creates wrapper charts routinely,
# and a published OCI tag is public and gets pinned by consumers.
#
# Every entry must carry a reason. A chart is tagged with its own Chart.yaml
# version, so bump that when you change the chart - the publish job skips a
# version that is already in the registry.
#
# A chart whose charts/ holds a symlink packages fine - Helm follows it and
# inlines the contents (verified on v4.0.1), so the tarball is self-contained.
# Such a parent therefore embeds its own copy of kubeaid-addons rather than
# resolving the published one; bump both when the addons chart changes.
kubeaid-addons                   # first-party; consumed standalone, as a subchart by 19 sibling charts, and by charts outside this repo
